  "body": "Would be great to have this feature, it would be like this:\n\n* Set the env variable `PATHMAP_PREFIX=${SHARUN_DIR}`\n\n* Then pathmap would check if something tries to open a file in `/usr/lib/librandom.so`, if `${PATHMAP_REPFIX}/lib/librandom.so` is present, it automatically overrides to that location. \n\n* `PATHMAP_PREFIX` also needs to be unset internally to prevent issues with nested instances of pathmap.\n\n---\n\nThis avoids setting the env variables for the multiple paths that need to be overriden and removes lots of trial and error during the process.\n\n\n",
